    "Ask Key stopped changing %1$@'s settings because it could not put the original settings back. A copy of the original files was kept in Ask Key's data folder, under client-backups, and Ask Key will not retry this change on its own. Open %1$@ and check that it still works. If it does not, report it on GitHub Issues with the client name and this message. Never include credential values.": {
      "extractionState": "extracted_with_value",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask Key stopped changing %1$@'s settings because it could not put the original settings back. A copy of the original files was kept in Ask Key's data folder, under client-backups, and Ask Key will not retry this change on its own. Open %1$@ and check that it still works. If it does not, report it on GitHub Issues with the client name and this message. Never include credential values."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请旨没能把 %1$@ 的原设置放回去，因此已停止修改。原文件的副本保存在请旨数据文件夹的 client-backups 中，请旨不会自行重试这次改动。请打开 %1$@，确认它仍能正常使用。如果不能，请在 GitHub Issues 报告，附上客户端名称和这段说明。不要附上任何凭证值。"
          }
        },
        "qps-ploc": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "[!!Ask Key stopped changing %1$@'s settings because it could not put the original settings back. A copy of the original files was kept in Ask Key's data folder, under client-backups, and Ask Key will not retry this change on its own. Open %1$@ and check that it still works. If it does not, report it on GitHub Issues with the client name and this message. Never include credential values.!!]"
          }
        }
      }
    },
